    "final_answer": "I have successfully found the Python Specialization on Coursera and identified all the skills. Let me provide the final answer.\n\n## Python Specialization Found on Coursera\n\n**Specialization**: **Python for Everybody** (面向所有人的 Python 专项课程)\n- **Provider**: University of Michigan\n- **Instructor**: Charles Russell Severance\n- **Rating**: 4.8/5 stars\n- **Reviews**: 280,733\n- **Enrolled**: 2,022,613 students\n- **Level**: Beginner\n- **Format**: 5-course series\n- **Languages**: Available in 27 languages including English\n\n**Description**: This Specialization builds on the success of the Python for Everybody course and introduces fundamental programming concepts including data structures, networked application program interfaces, and databases. Students learn to program and analyze data with Python, developing programs to gather, clean, analyze, and visualize data.\n\n### Skills You Will Learn (15 skills):\n\n1. **File Input/Output** (文件输入/输出)\n2. **Database Design** (数据库设计)\n3. **Programming Principles** (编程原则)\n4. **Data Visualization** (数据可视化)\n5. **Data Structures** (数据结构)\n6. **Data Presentation** (数据展示)\n7. **Web Services** (网络服务)\n8. **Query Languages** (查询语言)\n9. **Program Development** (计划发展)\n10. **Data Processing** (数据处理)\n11. **Web Scraping** (网络抓取)\n12. **Databases** (数据库)\n13. **Debugging** (调试)\n14. **Data Storage** (数据存储)\n15. **Data Visualization Software** (数据可视化软件)\n\n### Tools You Will Learn:\n\n1. **Relational Databases** (关系数据库)\n2. **REST APIs** (恢复性应用程序接口)\n3. **Database Software** (数据库软件)\n4. **JSON**\n5. **Python Programming** (Python 编程)",
